sol:'In 3D there are exactly 14 distinct Bravais lattices — the only translations-compatible point arrays — grouped into 7 systems (cubic, tetragonal, orthorhombic, monoclinic, triclinic, rhombohedral, hexagonal). Adding motif symmetries yields 32 point groups and 230 space groups: the complete structural census finished a century ago and never needed revision.',
